Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Terminal tabular data explorer
 tuitab is a fast, keyboard-driven terminal viewer for tabular data.
 It supports CSV, TSV, JSON, JSONL, YAML, TOML, Parquet, Excel (xlsx/xls),
 and SQLite files.  JSON, YAML and TOML open as a table over the parsed
 document, so nested structures can be browsed, edited and converted between
 formats without losing their shape.
 .
 Features include filtering, sorting, pivot tables, computed columns,
 column statistics, histograms and line/bar charts, transposing, and export.
 .
 The package provides three command names: tuitab, ttab, and ttb.
